# The app's direct dependencies, as ranges. This is the file to edit.
#
# Community Cloud does not read it: it installs requirements.txt, which
# pip-compile generates from this file with every package pinned, transitive
# ones included, for the Python version the deployed app runs (3.14). Never
# edit requirements.txt by hand. To change a dependency, edit this file, then
# recompile and rerun the test suite; the routine is in README.md, "Updating
# dependencies".
